<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Caribbean Task Force Ruby, 1963</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;This scenario assumes that ongoing tensions between the United States and Cuba following the Missile Crisis of 1962 led to a series of incidents during the next several years.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;In the present scenario, the United States is concerned about new tactical missile deployments on Cuba.&amp;nbsp; Your task force, consisting of a cruiser and three destroyers, with additional support from a submarine and aircraft at NAS Key West, has been sent to investigate.&amp;nbsp; Your patrol area is marked on the tactical map.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;-------------------------------------------------------&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;A delta template .ini file has been included in the .zip file to assist in updating the scenario to any future versions of the database.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0in 0in 0pt"&gt;Scenario Author: Mark Gellis&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
